window.products.push({"id":1118002,"name":"Pavilion Gift Company Dog Mom Ceramic Travel Mug, 15-Ounce, Mom Love","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GHs2f7JqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If there was ever someone worth celebrating day after day mom would be on the top of the list. Mom Love by Pavilion Gift features a variety of mom-themed gifts ranging from mugs, soup bowls, apparel and ornaments. The simple design and fresh, modern colors coupled with sweet sentiments make each piece something she will cherish for years to come. The entire collection is available on Amazon.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GHs2f7JqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pavilion Gift Company","source_asin":"B00O7WSF40","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1118002","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00O7WSF40","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00O7WSF40","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1118003,"name":"NYC, Brooklyn Bridge by Nina Papiorek, 35x47-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":87.07,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71E0kxfvb0L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a photograph of the Brooklyn Bridge. Nina Papiorek's work is as multilateral as her interests and motives. What combines all her works is the aim to catch a special moment with her camera, which has nothing to do with a particular technique or scenery, but a feeling she likes to capture. Nina's passion is black & white photography. In her opinion a photograph always lives from a unique moment, from an expressive face or from a story written in an observer's mind. Technique and equipment only play a secondary role. Nina finds her protagonists and motives on travels, on the street, in normal life- the urban way, the chaotic city, lonely districts, just to name a few. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71E0kxfvb0L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00BLYN2JU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1118003","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BLYN2JU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BLYN2JU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
