window.products.push({"id":1118027,"name":"HOUSE AGAIN Mesh Laundry Bag with Handles, Zipper Closure, Hanging Extra Large Mesh Bag for Laundry, Washable Laundry bag for College Dorm, Apartment,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814+ky6+nJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Washable mesh material, super sturdy and durable. The fine mesh allows air in so the laundry don't damp or smelly, which is more breathable than tranditional laundry hampers. Also, you can throw it into your washer or dryer with your laundry to clean and dry it. Easy to carry: This bag got two big handles, which makes it easier for you to transport your laundry up and down stairs, and much more convenient than to cart a basket. To make the handles sturdy and tear-resistant, tightly double stitching is adopted at the connecting position. Zipper closure: Unlike some drawstring laundry bags, the zipper design of our laundry bag makes it stayed tightly close during carrying and washing. No need to worry about that your clothes or delicates come out or tangled in the washer. Large capacity: 30×7.5×20 inches, providing a capacity of 60 L. Suitable for store your sweaters, sheets, blankest, delicate curtains and toys. You can also put the bag inside your laundry hampers or baskets and pull it out when it’s full. Space saver: Unlike a big laundry basket that takes up a lot of space, you can easily fold it up when you’re not using the bag. It will be a good helper for college, travel and camping. We also offer two sets of hooks, so you can hang it over the door or on the wall.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814+ky6+nJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOUSE AGAIN","source_asin":"B09TZWBW9L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1118027","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TZWBW9L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TZWBW9L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
