window.products.push({"id":1118053,"name":"Fair Trade Ghana Bolga African Shoulder Bag 14-16\" Across, #54554","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OyIg1i-FL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"You will receive a basket with a sea- side reminiscent mix of interwoven blue, green, and purple- no two are identical- each basket is uniquely handwoven and differs in design. In the Bolgatanga area of Ghana, weavers use the abundant Veta vera grass to weave these incredibly hardy, useful baskets. Coming from the Bolgatanga region of Ghana,this is a new shoulder bag with rolled and stitched leather shoulder straps. There is also a leather loop and knob closer at the top of the bag. Easily reshape your basket by quickly submerging in water, reshape by hand and hang to dry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OyIg1i-FL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Baskets of Africa","source_asin":"B01K5SPONO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1118053","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01K5SPONO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01K5SPONO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
