window.products.push({"id":1118057,"name":"The All-American Sun Oven ** Solar Powered Outdoor Oven / Dehydrator / Slow Cooker with Extra Large Cooking Chamber ** For Home Cooking, Base Camp, Di","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":479.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tA3LWnW2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE ULTIMATE SOLAR APPLIANCE: Cook, bake, dehydrate, slow-cook, boil, pasteurize, dry, even sterilize equipment. The Sun Oven is the world's most versatile solar cooker. The Sun Oven is not some tiny cooking tube gadget or a repurposed window sun shade. This is a real appliance that will perform for years. EXTRA LARGE COOKING CHAMBER: The Sun Oven offers a large cooking chamber that will support meals cooked in enamelware pots with lids, in a Dutch Oven, and other larger cookware. Bake bread, cook chili or stews, even corn on the cob for 6! You can cook a whole chicken and even a 14lb turkey in your Sun Oven. Compare that to other portable solar cookers! BASE CAMP, HOMESTEADING, DISASTER PREP:  You can cook for a large group at once using real kitchenware. The competition wants you to put tiny portions into a little tube, bits at a time! Making hungry people wait. The Sun Oven slow cooks meat like no other. If you're hunting game or birds you can slow cook yesterday's hunt and get melt-off-the-bone goodness. USE IT AT HOME FOR EVERYDAY COOKING & DRYING: Use it in the back yard any time. Even if you do have electricity or gas. Use it as a slow cooker, using normal kitchenware. Use it as a dehydrator appliance (jerky, sun-dried tomatoes, fruits and veggies, herbs). Use it as an oven and cook a whole bird, potatoes, and more. Hard boil eggs! Boil or pasteurize water! MADE IN AMERICA - For over 25 years we've stayed true to American manufacturing while still investing in solving a problem on a global scale. Solar cooking reduces carbon footprint and brings clean cooking ability to remote locations around the world.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tA3LWnW2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sun Oven","source_asin":"B08P2BHRJX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1118057","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08P2BHRJX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08P2BHRJX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
