window.products.push({"id":1118322,"name":"KOCASO Portable Handheld Vacuum Cleaner Automative Vacuum Cordless Rechargeable with High Power and Strong Suction Mini Lightweight Car Vacuum Cleaner","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61B9ZZTrr5S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"<p>*4800PA Cyclonic Powerful Suction: KOCASO cordless vacuum cleaner features with 120W power motor and offers 4800 PA cyclonic suction which can suck up the dust, pet hair, crumbs ,food residue ,and other small things in your car,offices and home easily .As a dust busters cordless rechargeable, it aims to providing an Clean and comfortable environment for you. </p> <p>* Improved & Reusable & Washable HEPA Filter: Our hand vacuum cleaner boasts enhanced HEPA filter and multi-stage filter system, which helps to further extend the lifetime and effectively avoid clog of filters. Moreover, the HEPA filter in vacuum is reusable and washable. What can you remove and wash it when you find the Suction power of car vacuum cleaner dropping.Please Please dry it after cleaning to keep powerful suction every time.  </p> <p>*Multi-functional & All-Round Cleaning: This Handheld Home Car Cleaner provides deep cleaning for your house and car, helping you clean the dust in sofas, wall, stairs and other hard-to-reach areas with 3 accessories (Brush, Hose, Crevice Nozzle). The brush can be used to clean human and pet hair and the dirty stick. The soft long hose can be used to clean the surface of leather without damage. The long mouth can be used to capture the debris at narrow corner or space.  </p> <p>* Wet & Dry Use and Runnning Long Time: Support dry and wet use, quickly absorb the spilt liquid (except corrosive, flammable and explosive liquid), pet hair and debris even they fall into hard-to-reach area in the car with the included external 13cm/ 5.12inch long suction nozzle. The hand held vacumn cleaners is equipped with long-lasting and rechargeable Lithium Battery, it can be used up to 30min and fully charged in 3-4 hours. </p> <p>* Cordless Lightweight Vacuum and Easy Removal & Installation: This cordless hand vacuum weighs only 1.06 pounds, it is lightweight and portable enough to help you clean everywhere at home or in your car easily . Moreover, As a little vacuum cleaner , the mini handheld vacuum is easy to assemble and disassemble, just mainly consists of three parts. Unlimited design makes it more convenient for you to use. </p>","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61B9ZZTrr5S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KOCASO","source_asin":"B093WGHQ92","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1118322","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093WGHQ92","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093WGHQ92","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
