window.products.push({"id":1118350,"name":"HOME-X Refillable Glass Perfume Bottle with Atomizer, Purple Body Spray Pump for Women","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71it7wqWA0L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Some things will always be classics: vinyl records, the Charleston, the big band sound, and, of course, perfume bottles with tassels. Classic perfume bottles with atomizer nozzles are timeless and the science behind them works just as well today as it did in the early twentieth century when atomizers were invented. The technology was first used by doctors to apply mists to patients’ throats. Since then, this invention has been used for a variety of purposes, including spraying perfumes. This classic bottle is royal purple and the atomizer is covered in a light purple woven pattern with a tassel on the end. This bottle comes empty so that you can put your desired eau de toilette inside and use it daily. Whether you buy high-end fragrances or prefer to buy less-expensive perfumes, this bottle will help them last and will turn them into the perfect stream of mist. Fill this container with your signature scent or try something new. This is the perfect vial for homemade fragrances. It can also be used with certain essential oils if desired. Because it is empty, you can use this perfume bottle to decorate the living room, bedroom, or bathroom to add a touch of elegance and refinement. It makes a great gift for that special woman in your life who appreciates the finer things. Give it to your wife, sister, mother, girlfriend, or another person who would love it! Our perfume bottle is not a perfect circle but has a classic apple shape, making it unique. The gold nozzle adds even more class and has a pointed top. Get our vintage perfume bottle today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71it7wqWA0L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home-X","source_asin":"B07N5LCYY9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1118350","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07N5LCYY9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07N5LCYY9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
