window.products.push({"id":1118535,"name":"Senmiya Kids Duvet Cover Set Kitt Bedding Set 100 Percent Cotton Duvet Cover Twin XL + 2 Pillow Shams, Bunk Bed Girls Comforter Set Lightweight Down C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41pXxHdLetL._AC_.jpg","description":"Our animal print duvet cover sets offer a luxuriously soft look for your understated, chic style. In 100% cotton, the duvet cover reverses for an alternate look to your bedroom's décor, and the bed is complete with matching pillow shams. How to Put on A Duvet Cover? Lay the comforter flat. Insert your hands inside and find the two top corners. holding one corner in each hand. With your hands inside the duvet cover, reach down to grab hold of the comforter’s top two corners. Holding the top two corners tightly, give it a shake and a fluff until the duvet cover falls down to cover most of the comforter. Stuff the bottom two corners of the comforter inside the bottom two corners of the duvet cover. zip it up at last! Care Instruction Machine wash with cold water; Do not bleach; Tumble dry, low heat; Iron, Medium; Do not dry-clean Refresh the look of your comforter with this trendy duvet set！","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41pXxHdLetL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Senmiya","source_asin":"B07H74C269","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1118535","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07H74C269","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07H74C269","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1118536,"name":"Kitchen Mat, [2PCS] Anti Fatigue Mat Luminous Floor Comfort Mat, Waterproof Non-Slip Kitchen Rugs, Thick Perfect Ergonomic Foam Standing mat for Kitch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WpbmfA6wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Exquisite & Practical Floor Comfort Rugs for Kitchen Material: High-Density Memory Foam PVC Thick Cushioned: 0.4inch/10MM Size: 17 \"x30\"+17 \"x47\" Style: classic, simple, casual and luminous design Comfortable & Non-Slip Made of high-quality PVC material with great resilience performance and its ergonomic design. Safe and Slip-Resistant This thick cushion comfort standing mat provides ample support for your foot and knees over long periods of standing. Constructed with a smooth beveled edge and slip-resistant backing, the Cozy Living mat prevents slipping, sliding, or tripping. The slip-resistant backing helps the mat to stay in place on any flat surfaces such as tile, hardwood, or concrete. Perfect for any high traffic areas in your home. Suitable for Any Space These durable kitchen rugs waterproof is perfect for any space in your home or office. You can use this anti-fatigue mat as a standing desk mat in your office, a kitchen rug, a bathroom vanity mat, a playroom mat, or even a mat for the mudroom. Easy to Clean These mats are waterproof, oil, and stain-resistant. When spills and accidents occur, you can simply wipe it away with a damp cloth or sponge. These durable anti-fatigue mat kitchens are low maintenance and easy to clean for long-lasting use and beauty. About Packing: The kitchen mat anti-fatigue is shipped rolled, so the rug may not lay flat on the floor when it is just out of the package. Just relax. Allow the memory foam kitchen mat to rest for several days, reverse rolling or put heavy things on it, it will be flattened out. About Smell: The rug is made from environmental PVC, so it may have a slight smell, just air it out for hours, the smell will be gone.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WpbmfA6wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sunhop","source_asin":"B094DBCRGQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1118536","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B094DBCRGQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B094DBCRGQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
