window.products.push({"id":1118688,"name":"𝐄𝐋𝐄𝐂𝐓𝐑𝐈𝐂 𝐒𝐀𝐋𝐀𝐃 𝐒𝐏𝐈𝐍𝐍𝐄𝐑, WeluvFit Lettuce Spinner with 𝐔𝐒𝐁 𝐑𝐄𝐂𝐇𝐀𝐑𝐆𝐄𝐀𝐁𝐓𝐄 and 4 Liters Large Capacity, BPA Free Vegetable Dryer For Fast Crispy Salads Pr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718FbEJwLsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🥗Time-saving Salad Spinner: WeluvFit electric vegetable spinner is different from other time-consuming and labor-intensive manual operations. It allows you to spin drying vegetables and fruits more quickly and efficiently and take your salad-making work to a higher level. Easy to use: USB fast charging, one-key start, automatic stop after 10s of operation. And it can be used more than 100 times when fully charged. Save your time and free your hands. 🍲Health Becomes Simpler: The most troublesome problem is the tedious and time-consuming washing or drying of vegetables and fruits when preparing a nutritious, healthy salad. WeluvFit lettuce spinner provides convenience for you, makes cooking more exciting and time-saving. Spin drying vegetables and fruits quickly and easily, or wash some fruits and vegetables that are easy to clean. Fresh, crispy, clean, healthy, and delicious salads help you nourish and maintain a healthy family life. 🍒Unparalleled Quality: WeluvFit's professional vegetable dryer comprises specially thickened, high-hardness, and high-toughness food-grade reinforced plastic. It is not easily broken and is BPA-free. It uses non-toxic materials, is durable, safe, and reliable. It is suitable for all kinds of vegetables and fruits, and it is the best choice for your family. The treated non-slip lid is not easy to slip off, avoiding confusion, allowing you to enjoy the fun of spinning carefree. 🍽️Multifunctional: WeluvFit salad dryer provides you with significant economic value, helps you make delicious salads, and promotes a healthier lifestyle. The 4-quart large-capacity transparent bowl can be used as a delicate salad bowl, elegant serving bowl, or fresh lettuce storage bowl. The basket with a simple drainage system for washing and spin-drying can help you clean vegetable colanders and quickly dry salads with the highest efficiency. 🥦Easy to Maintain: WeluvFit's thoughtful and innovative lettuce dryer can be used for storage and cooks. It is very easy to clean: it can be washed directly or in mild soapy water. The detachable turntable design ensures barrier-free cleaning and helps keep it clean and tidy. But please make sure that the USB hole is closed when cleaning the cover. Please do not put the salad spinner in the dishwasher to maintain its quality and hardness.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718FbEJwLsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WeluvFit","source_asin":"B09DS5DLM2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1118688","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DS5DLM2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DS5DLM2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1118689,"name":"Acrylic Picture Frame,Desktop Frameless Photo Frame with Magnetic,Clear Freestanding Double Sided (4\"x6\")","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51b0MAESVDS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"❤CHOICE OF QUALITY---Advanced acrylic material, with transparent and flawless surface, looks more advanced than ordinary materials, and can be given as a gift in festivals. ❤STRONG MAGNETS---Two acrylic panels are simply latched with 4 pairs of magnets to hold the photos in, super easy to assemble and change picture, no tools needed. ❤ DOUBLE SIDED DISPLAY---The clear acrylic photo frame with double sided see through frames allow you to view from both sides. ❤GOOD PACKAGE---Each of our products will reach you safely, and they will be packed in a separate gift box. Maintenance Tips 1.Wash your hands before installation, to avoid leaving fingerprints on the frame or get dirty photos. 2.Use soft cloth to wipe the frame surface when you want to clean it. Add several drops of mild soap or alcohol when there is stubborn stain on it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51b0MAESVDS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yisen","source_asin":"B08Y7Y6RZ2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1118689","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Y7Y6RZ2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Y7Y6RZ2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
