window.products.push({"id":1118786,"name":"RockDaMic Incense Stick Holder, Octagon Tower Ash Catcher Wooden Handmade, Incense Burner Holday, Aromatherapy for Modern Gift Wood Home Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TF6wcWTpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BEAUTIFULLY-DESIGNED OCTAGON TOWER INCENSE STICK AND CONE HOLDER - are you looking for a stylish way to burn incense sticks or cones? This incense stick and cone holder is 11 inches tall and is designed beautifully to hold your incense while burning. AN EASY TO USE INCENSE STICK AND CONE HOLDER - do you want a simple way to burn incense sticks and cones? This octagon tower is very easy to use. Raise the tower from the base and insert the sticks on the designated holes. Light the sticks and carefully re-attach the tower to the base. When using cones, simply place the cone in the holder and do the same. SAFE AND CONVENIENT OCTAGON TOWER - are you looking for a safe and convenient way to burn incense sticks and cones? This octagon tower is perfect for you. This tower allows the incense sticks to burn downward, rather than sideways. Your furniture is also protected since the ashes stay in the holder. A MULTIFUNCTIONAL AND DECORATIVE TOWER - do you want to take advantage of an octagon tower that has many functions? This 11-inch octagon tower is the right one! This tower can burn 4 incense sticks at the same time. The center of the base can hold an incense cone. The ashes also stay in the holder. The beautiful and elegant design of this octagon tower makes it a decorative piece at home, office, or spa. GET YOUR MONEY’S WORTH WITH A PREMIUM-QUALITY OCTAGON TOWER - you get a high-quality and decorative incense stick and cone holder. If, for any reason you are not happy with your purchase, let us know and we’ll make it right for you. We are committed to providing the best products and service to our customers. Get your octagon tower risk-free with our premium brand guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TF6wcWTpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RockDaMic","source_asin":"B08GQGBBKF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1118786","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GQGBBKF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GQGBBKF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1118787,"name":"Square Fitted Flowers Tablecloth, Mandala Bohemian Colorful Flowers, Elastic Edge, Suitable for Table Decoration, Buffet and Camping, Fit for 44\"x44\" ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.24,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ibgBDEIKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our tablecloths are the essential restaurant core for gatherings with friends and family. High-quality materials: All of our white tablecloths are made of high-quality polyester, super soft, durable and wrinkle-resistant, and will not fade after many years of use. Measure your table before ordering: The size we describe is the size of the tablecloth. Not the size of a table. When you place an order, please make sure that the width and length of your table is shorter than our tablecloth. Wide range of applications: Immediately illuminate the dining table while protecting the surface. Our tablecloths are perfect for casual dining, daily meals with family, parties, birthdays, baby showers or special holiday parties. Care instructions: Both hand wash and machine wash are available, and air drying is the best way to dry, because polyester dries relatively quickly. Iron at low temperature, dry at low temperature, do not bleach.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ibgBDEIKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DESPKON","source_asin":"B09NSH91QR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1118787","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NSH91QR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NSH91QR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1118788,"name":"Bormioli Rocco Premium Sparkling Water Glasses, Set of 6 , 14 ounces","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.12,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Uh6EIgRyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The fine tradition of the Bormioli Rocco Group coincides with the very history of glass: the first glassworks was established in Parma in 1825. The company has always demonstrated a great drive to pioneer innovation: in machinery, materials and design. Over the years it has developed a special talent, that of combining time-honoured craftsmanship and the passion of master glassmakers with modern industrial processes. Bormioli Rocco is the leading company in its sector in Italy and a great ambassador of the Made in Italy label on international markets. Respect for tradition, passion for good taste and constant research and innovation are Bormioli Rocco's milestones to create products that meet the needs of the consumers. For Bormioli Rocco the respect for the enviroment; it's a must so its entire manufacturing process is oriented towards a mission of social and enviromental responsibility.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Uh6EIgRyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bormioli Rocco","source_asin":"B000QS4L60","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1118788","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000QS4L60","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000QS4L60","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1118789,"name":"Electric Milk Frother Handheld, Whisk Drink Mixer for Coffee, Mini Mixer and Coffee Blender Frother Electric Coffee Stirrers For Cappuccino, Hot Choco","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51oq1VYh3wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Milk frothers provide a professional finishing touch to your latte, cappuccino, macchiato or hot chocolate. Make delicious milk froth for your drinks at home with your own milk frother. The benefits of having your own electric beverage blender are endless, you can make your own lattes and you know you are tasting the best. It works better than a manual matcha whisk and is much better than a fork or hand whisk when it comes to making coffee. Convenient, time saving and easy to use. It works great with no extra containers, mixers or bottle shakers to clean. Cleanup of this milk frother is simple and quick. Insert one end of the whisk into tap water or soapy water and give it a short spin before pressing the button for 2-3 seconds for easy cleaning. Simply press it to create rich, creamy peaks. The blender is battery-powered, so you don't have to worry about cords and finding an outlet. Heat the milk, dip the espresso machine into the cup, and turn it on. The milk frother will immediately start creating creamy foam on the milk. Within 15-20 seconds, your cup is full of creamy foam and ready to go into your cafe latte. (Batteries not included) The advantages of using a coffee frother are that it allows you to create professional-quality frothed milk at home, giving your drinks a cafe-style touch. Frothed milk creates a smooth and creamy texture that enhances the flavor of your coffee or espresso. Using a coffee frother is an excellent way to enhance your coffee experience at home by creating delicious and creamy drinks. To achieve great results, use high-quality whole milk at the right temperature and practice your technique. When storing your coffee frother, make sure it is completely dry before storing in a cool and dry place where it won’t get knocked around or damaged. Cleaning and storing your coffee frother regularly will ensure its longevity and continued effectiveness.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51oq1VYh3wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fleaks Funly","source_asin":"B0C8NCLMRF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1118789","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C8NCLMRF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C8NCLMRF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
